  "extractionNotes": "Employee at 1/4 time since 2024-10-01 (small employer); an earlier short employment 2022-06-22..2022-09-05. Salary exactly 1/4 of the minimum wage (1075.00 in 2024, 1166.50 in 2025), 13.71% deducted. Pregnancy sick leave from 2025-02-18; employer sick pay 2025-02-18..2025-03-22 (33 days), ZUS sickness benefit from 2025-03-23. A ZUS letter said the benefit for 2025-02-18 onwards could not be paid without the employer's Z-3 (deadline 2025-05-27); the end of the claimed period in that letter is not reliably legible, so the plan block ends on 2025-05-27 as an inferred placeholder and the expected period is not asserted. Internal note: sickness benefit granted. Code B (pregnancy) inferred from the file label. Due date and birth not in the file; mode set to adjudication."
